<title>ITALY: Reuters 1st ex-Italy air cargo rates table.</title>
<headline>Reuters 1st ex-Italy air cargo rates table.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Italy air cargo rates calculated from direct and off line service for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one. Fuel surcharge is not included</p>
<p>Destination	   April 3	  Feb 18</p>
<p>YUL/YYZ		 2,280	    2,165</p>
<p>CHI		     2,450	    2,450</p>
<p>NYC		     2,350	    2,350</p>
<p>MIA		     2,475	    2,420</p>
<p>LAX/SFO		 2,675	    2,625</p>
<p>MEX		     3,785	    3,785</p>
<p>CCS		     3,800	    3,800</p>
<p>RIO		     5,270	    5,270</p>
<p>BUE		     5,910	    5,910</p>
<p>SCL		     5,765	    5,765</p>
<p>NBO		     3,450	    3,450</p>
<p>JNB		     4,450	    4,450</p>
<p>DBX		     2,100	    2,150</p>
<p>BOM		     2,775	    2,775</p>
<p>DEL		     2,800	    2,800</p>
<p>SIN		     2,755	    2,755</p>
<p>HKG		     2,775	    2,775</p>
<p>SEL		     4,130	    4,130</p>
<p>TYO		     4,690	    4,690</p>
<p>OSA		     4,950	    4,950</p>
<p>PEK		     4,300	    4,300</p>
<p>SHA		     4,010	    4,010</p>
<p>BKK		     2,925	    2,925</p>
<p>SYD/MEL		 5,555	    5,555</p>
<p>AKL		     5,300	    5,460</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in lira per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
